{"chapter":{"id":112,"name_simple":"Al-Ikhlas","name_arabic":"الإخلاص","verses_count":4,"revelation_place":"makkah","translated_name":{"language_name":"english","name":"The Sincerity"}},"verses":[{"id":6222,"verse_number":1,"verse_key":"112:1","text_uthmani":" قُلْ هُوَ ٱللَّهُ أَحَدٌ","juz_number":30,"page_number":604,"translations":[{"resource_id":20,"text":"Say, \"He is Allāh, [who is] One,"},{"resource_id":133,"text":"(நபியே! மனிதர்களை நோக்கி) கூறுவீராக: அல்லாஹ் ஒருவன்தான்."}]},{"id":6223,"verse_number":2,"verse_key":"112:2","text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ ٱلصَّمَدُ","juz_number":30,"page_number":604,"translations":[{"resource_id":20,"text":"Allāh, the Eternal Refuge."},{"resource_id":133,"text":"(அந்த) அல்லாஹ் (எவருடைய) தேவையுமற்றவன். (அனைத்தும் அவன் அருளையே எதிர்பார்த்திருக்கின்றன.)"}]},{"id":6224,"verse_number":3,"verse_key":"112:3","text_uthmani":"لَمْ يَلِدْ وَلَمْ يُولَدْ","juz_number":30,"page_number":604,"translations":[{"resource_id":20,"text":"He neither begets nor is born,"},{"resource_id":133,"text":"அவன் (எவரையும்) பெறவுமில்லை; (எவராலும்) பெறப்படவுமில்லை. (ஆகவே, அவனுக்குத் தகப்பனுமில்லை சந்ததியுமில்லை.)"}]},{"id":6225,"verse_number":4,"verse_key":"112:4","text_uthmani":"وَلَمْ يَكُن لَّهُۥ كُفُوًا أَحَدٌۢ","juz_number":30,"page_number":604,"translations":[{"resource_id":20,"text":"Nor is there to Him any equivalent.\""},{"resource_id":133,"text":"(தவிர) அவனுக்கு ஒப்பாகவும் (நிகராகவும்) ஒன்றுமில்லை."}]}],"pagination":{"total_records":4,"total_pages":1,"current_page":1}}